1.2 Firestore Collections Blueprint (firebase-blueprint.json)
The app uses 3 subcollections under /users/{userId}:
/users/{userId}/positions/{positionId} — Open / running trades (pos_{ticketId} for "main" account, or pos_{accountKey}_{ticketId} for additional accounts)
/users/{userId}/history/{historyId} — Closed trades and balance withdrawals (hist_{tradeId} for "main" account, or hist_{accountKey}_{tradeId} for additional accounts)
/users/{userId}/accounts/{accountDocId} — Trading accounts (main for primary account, or acc_{timestamp}_{rand})
