// Key rendering and coordinate math inside CandlestickChart:
// 1. Price <-> Y coordinate mapping:
//    val ratio = (topGridPrice - price) / totalGridPriceSpan
//    val y = (topGridMargin + ratio * gridSpanPx).toFloat()
//
// 2. Candle Index <-> X coordinate mapping:
//    val x = candleOriginX - ((n - 1 - globalIdx) * totalCandleSlot) + clampedPan
//
// 3. Layer Draw Order inside Canvas:
//    a) Horizontal dashed price grid lines + right-axis price labels
//    b) Vertical dashed time grid lines + bottom-axis timestamps (every 3rd grid column)
//    c) Candlesticks (wick + body) & Moving Average path
//    d) Trade History dashed connectors + entry/exit deal arrows
//    e) Open Position SL/TP/Entry dashed lines + entry arrows (drawn ON TOP of candlesticks)
//    f) Right-axis badges for SL, TP, and Open Position price box
//    g) Current Ask (Red #EF5350) & Bid (Teal #26A69A) horizontal lines + Right-axis Bid/Ask/Countdown badges
//    h) Open Position inline text ("BUY 0.01, +0.30 USD") drawn ON TOP of candlesticks and Bid/Ask lines
//    i) Crosshair lines + inspected price badge
